# "If it's a green card" is a color word of Tamiyo, Seasoned Scholar's text (CR 612.2). Bot1's Mind Bend replaces green
# with blue in it, so her -3 returning Natural Order (green, put into the graveyard by Bot2's Duress) adds no mana: the
# changed text asks whether the card is blue (CR 612.1). Tamiyo transforms on Bot1's third draw of turn 3 (the draw step,
# Ponder, Brainstorm), and Brainstorm puts two Islands back, keeping Mind Bend.
